10292</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>EMLD</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://cge.mdanderson.org/~qhuang/Software/pub.htm"/></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>SNPHAP</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www-gene.cimr.cam.ac.uk/clayton/software/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meng</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Zaykin</surname><given-names>DV</given-names></name><name><surname>Xu</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><name><surname>Wagner</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ehm</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Selection of genetic markers for association analyses, using linkage disequilibrium and haplotypes</article-title><source>Am J Hum Genet</source><year>2003</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>115</fpage><lpage>130</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12796855</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1086/376561</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ott</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>Analysis of Human Genetic Linkage</source><year>1985</year><publisher-name>Baltimore: The Johns Hopkins University Press</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>